# i18n

- Locales: `ru` (default), `en`, `uz` — all keys must exist in each.
- No hardcoded user-facing strings in templates or UI TypeScript.
- Use Transloco (`@senbilan/shared/i18n` helpers/providers when available).
- Key shape: `scope.path` (e.g. `users.create`, `common.save`).
- DS components receive labels from callers; do not embed product copy in DS.
- Run `npm run i18n:check` when adding/changing keys.
